 Day compilation was released in 2024 to mark the label's 30th anniversary.\r\nA history of the label is detailed in [m=821713].\r\nThe name and label design was inspired by early disco label [l=Henry Street Records].","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:324","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":[{"id":8262,"name":"Muggsy Records"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/324-Henry-Street-Music","type":"label","urls":["https://x.com/Henry_St_Music","https://www.facebook.com/HenryStreetMusic","https://www.instagram.com/henrystreetmusic","https://www.mixcloud.com/HenryStreetMusic","https://soundcloud.com/henry-street-music","https://www.youtube.com/user/HENRYSTREETMUSIC"]}},"/api/discogs/label/36605/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"36605","image":"https://i.discogs.com/iYjg72a-p99rnvcNIpe2dd-UcCbDXGSjc6L7_PA1I7Y/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTM2NjA1/LTE1MDAxMDc2NDYt/NTQzNy5wbmc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/Wa2LkZ9Mi3u3oInaN8-83xYZ9AFgPdTSJIeSaLzG_c8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTM2NjA1/LTE1MDAxMDc2NDYt/NTQzNy5wbmc.jpeg","profile":"US record label founded by [a803613] in San Francisco, California in 2001, and specializing in 180 gram vinyl reissues. The label is part of the Runt label group, and CD editions were released simultaneously by [l16925] until 2014. The label's name was taken from the presumed appearance of \"record-collecting geeks like you and me.\"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:36605","relations":{"parentLabel":{"id":54305,"name":"Runt"},"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/36605-4-Men-With-Beards","type":"label","urls":["https://www.runtshop.com/4men.html","https://www.facebook.com/pages/Runt/459315864146396","https://twitter.com/runtshop","https://books.google.com/books?id=BgwEAAAAMBAJ&lpg=PA87&dq=4%20men%20with%20beards%20billboard&pg=PA87#v=onepage&q=four%20me